@fleetops_backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5107
@existingDriverId = 1
@existingVehicleId = 1
@existingInspectionId = 1
@existingTripId = 1
### ============================================
### INSPECTION FLOW
### ============================================
### 
### STEP 1: Get Inspection Items untuk ditampilkan di frontend
### Endpoint ini mengembalikan daftar item yang perlu diinspeksi
### Frontend akan menampilkan setiap item dengan 2 tombol: "Ok" dan "Tidak"
###

### 1.1 Get All Inspection Items
GET {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/inspections/items
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### STEP 2: User menginput hasil inspeksi
### ============================================
### 
### Flow di frontend:
### - Loop setiap item dari GET /api/inspections/items
### - User klik "Ok" → Condition = 1
### - User klik "Tidak" → Condition = 0 (dan user upload photo + catatan)
### - Submit semua hasil ke POST /api/inspections/create
###
### Contoh scenario:
### - Item 1 (Ban) → User klik Ok (Condition = 1)
### - Item 2 (Lampu) → User klik Tidak (Condition = 0), upload photo, tambah catatan
### - Item 3 (Rem) → User klik Ok (Condition = 1)
###

### 2.1 Create Inspection - Semua Item Ok (tidak ada photo/catatan)
POST {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/inspections/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driverId": {{existingDriverId}},
  "vehicleId": {{existingVehicleId}},
  "results": [
    {
      "itemId": 1,
      "condition": 1,
      "note": null,
      "photoIndex": null
    },
    {
      "itemId": 2,
      "condition": 1,
      "note": null,
      "photoIndex": null
    },
    {
      "itemId": 3,
      "condition": 1,
      "note": null,
      "photoIndex": null
    }
  ],
  "photos": []
}

### 2.2 Create Inspection - Ada Item Tidak Ok dengan Photo + Catatan
POST {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/inspections/create
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DriverId"

{{existingDriverId}}
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="VehicleId"

{{existingVehicleId}}
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Results[0].ItemId"

1
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Results[0].Condition"

1
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Results[1].ItemId"

2
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Results[1].Condition"

0
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Results[1].Note"

Lampu rusak, perlu diganti
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Results[1].PhotoIndex"

0
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Results[2].ItemId"

3
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Results[2].Condition"

1
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Photos"; filename="broken-light.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-image.jpg
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

