### ============================================
### GET INSPECTION RESULTS
### ============================================

### 3.1 Get Inspection by ID
GET {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/inspections/{{existingInspectionId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.2 Get All Inspections by Driver
GET {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/inspections/driver/{{existingDriverId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.3 Get All Inspections by Vehicle
GET {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/inspections/vehicle/{{existingVehicleId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.4 Get Today's Inspections
GET {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/inspections/today
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### UPDATE & DELETE
### ============================================

### 4.1 Update Inspection
PUT {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/inspections/{{existingInspectionId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DriverId"

{{existingDriverId}}
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="VehicleId"

{{existingVehicleId}}
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Results[0].ItemId"

1
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Results[0].Condition"

1
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 4.2 Delete Inspection
DELETE {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/inspections/{{existingInspectionId}}
Content-Type: application/json


